    <string name="pump_info_title">Pump information</string>
    <string name="pump_info_message">Current state\nPump A: %1$s\nPump B: %2$s\n\nON means the pump relay is active. OFF means it is stopped. Pump behavior can be automated by the water level or controlled manually from the Control screen.</string>
    <string name="sensor_info_title">Sensor information</string>
    <string name="sensor_info_message">Current connection\npH: %1$s\nTDS: %2$s\nTurbidity: %3$s\n\nReading guide\npH measures acidity; 6.5-8.5 is the acceptable range.\nTDS measures dissolved solids; below 50 ppm is very low, 50-300 ppm is excellent, 301-500 ppm is good, and above 500 ppm is poor.\nTurbidity measures cloudiness; up to 1.5 NTU is clear, 1.6-4.0 NTU is slightly turbid, and above 4.0 NTU is turbid.</string>

